From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wine.inf: Windows.UI.Xaml on for NanaZip's file manager

---
diff --git a/loader/wine.inf.in b/loader/wine.inf.in
index 72a93f5..5bdaf23 100644
--- a/loader/wine.inf.in
+++ b/loader/wine.inf.in
@@ -2941,6 +2941,9 @@ HKLM,Software\Wine\AppDefaults\WindowsTerminal.exe,"SgXaml",0x10001,1
 ; OneDrive (wine-sg 6219): its sign-in and first-run windows are XAML; without it OneDrive.exe
 ; shows only its tray icon.
 HKLM,Software\Wine\AppDefaults\OneDrive.exe,"SgXaml",0x10001,1
+; NanaZip (wine-sg 7710): its file manager's toolbar and menus are a XAML island; without XAML
+; it stops at "K7ModernInitialize Failed". Its other programs (extraction, console) do not need it.
+HKLM,Software\Wine\AppDefaults\NanaZip.Modern.FileManager.exe,"SgXaml",0x10001,1
 
 [LicenseInformation]
 ; based on information from http://www.geoffchappell.com/notes/windows/license/install.htm
